        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: تایا",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تایا — tāyā — \"a father's elder brother\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "میرے تایا ابو سے بڑے ہیں۔ mere tāyā abbū se baṛe haiṅ. My uncle is older than my father."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تایا (tāyā) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin tāyā under Sanskrit tātyá, \"fatherly\" (CDIAL 5759)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
